%% Title: Room Creation Flow
%% Description: Steps from topic selection to live debate room

flowchart TD
    A[Dashboard] --> B[Enter Topic or<br/>Pick Preset]
    B --> C[Select 2-5 Agents]
    C --> D[Navigate to<br/>Room Setup]
    D --> E[Confirm Topic]
    E --> F[Review Agent Cards]
    F --> G[Select User Role]
    G --> H{Add Context?}
    H -- URL --> I[POST /rag/ingest-url]
    H -- File --> J[POST /rag/ingest-file]
    I --> K[Chunks Embedded<br/>in ChromaDB]
    J --> K
    H -- Skip --> L[Click Start Room]
    K --> L
    L --> M[POST /session/start]
    M --> N[Create Room + Session<br/>in SQLite]
    N --> O[Generate LiveKit Token]
    O --> P[Dispatch Agent Worker<br/>via LiveKit API]
    P --> Q[Navigate to<br/>Room Active]
    Q --> R[Connect to LiveKit Room]
